    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8254e619d80fe4b670bf9e64",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……你明白跟我去地狱是什么意思吗。\n你将前往充满死亡，充满悲鸣的丑陋世界……在永劫轮回中徘徊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f25e8fb96e5e9c24a8a736b93b8f4a464bdcf5e766be7f3b7ec21f07d1643d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0029/storytimeline_090029007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
