    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54286481e0dd0911df8ff5a7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "反正这条命总会没的。没什么意义――神也没有给出意义。\n所以我就更喜欢地狱了。能自己给自己赋予价值。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18b1458106a1812b92a1519d41fb9c14d8ca5f992720739643894f90d0f2229a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
